   Bragelmann, Johannes and Hucho, Tim and von Karstedt, Silvia and Peifer,
   Martin and Annibaldi, Alessandro and Hansel-Hertsch, Robert and
   Persigehl, Thorsten and Grull, Holger and Sos, Martin L. and
   Reifenberger, Guido and Fischer, Matthias and Adriaensen, Dirk and
